## Common Patterns

### Chat Interface
```typescript
const { messages, input, handleInputChange, handleSubmit } = useChat();
```

### Text Completion
```typescript
const { completion, input, handleInputChange, handleSubmit } = useCompletion();
```

### Structured Data Generation
```typescript
const { object, isLoading } = useObject({
  api: '/api/generate',
  schema: mySchema,
});
```

